<title>USA: F&amp;M Bancorp names John Johnson president.</title>
<headline>F&amp;M Bancorp names John Johnson president.</headline>
<dateline>KAUKAUNA, Wis. 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>F&amp;M Bancorp said Tuesday that its board of directors named John Johnson president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>He replaces Gary Lichtenberg, who resigned for personal reasons.</p>
<p>Johnson has been a board member and a member of the bank holding company's office of the chairman, the company said.</p>
<p>	 ((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
